@host = https://localhost:7001
@apiKey = development-only-key

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### List members
GET {{host}}/api/members
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Calendar
GET {{host}}/api/calendar?from=2026-08-01&to=2026-08-31
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Create reservation
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
X-Correlation-ID: sample-create-001

{
  "clubNumber": "001",
  "cabinDate": "2026-08-15",
  "sourceChannel": "Email",
  "idempotencyKey": "email-provider-message-id-001"
}
